n><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.51em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">入口</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>对比 (2)：<code>x_6</code> 从「栈上第一个」回到了寄存器，<code>x_7</code>、<code>x_8</code> 的栈偏移也各上移 8 字节。<strong>结构体大小跨过 16 字节这条线，会同时改变返回方式和参数布局</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> 调用者在自己的栈帧里预留 32 字节（比如放在 <code>%rsp</code> 之下或局部变量区），把这个地址放进 <code>%rdi</code>，再执行 <code>call make</code>：</p>\n<p><pre class=\"code-block\"><code class=\"language-c\">struct Big t;                 /* 调用者预留 32 字节 */\nt = make(1, 2, 3, 4);        /* 实际调用：make(&amp;t, 1, 2, 3, 4) 形式 */</code></pre></p>\n<code>make</code> 直接把字段写进这块内存，<code>%rax</code> 返回同一个地址。因为返回对象已经&quot;就地&quot;构造，通常不需要额外的拷贝；但如果调用者写 <code>return make(...);</code> 或整体赋值，编译器可能仍会生成一次 32 字节的 <code>memcpy</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>(5)</strong> 内联后隐藏指针通常<strong>不再作为 ABI 参数存在</strong>：编译器能看到目标对象 <code>t</code>，可以直接把 <code>1,2,3,4</code> 写进 <code>t</code> 的四个字段（甚至优化到寄存器里），不必真的构造临时对象再拷贝。隐藏指针是&quot;跨函数调用&quot;的 ABI 约定，内联把调用边界消掉了，这个约定就失效了。也正因如此，<code>make</code> 的汇编不能直接当作&quot;任何调用都不会拷贝&quot;的证据——是否拷贝取决于优化后的代码。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把 <code>%rsi</code> 当成第一个参数 <code>x</code>，没意识到 <code>%rdi</code> 被返回缓冲区占用。二是把栈上第一个参数写成 <code>8(%rbp)</code>（那其实是返回地址），或忘记隐藏指针不影响栈偏移而把 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 算到 <code>8(%rsp)</code>。三是认为 16 字节结构体也走内存返回；实际上是 <code>%rax:%rdx</code> 两段返回。四是以为内联后仍会按 ABI 传隐藏指针，忽略内联会消除调用边界。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>%rdi 是调用者为返回值预留的缓冲区地址（隐藏指针），x、y、z、w 分别在 %rsi、%rdx、%rcx、%r8；8 个 long 参数时只剩 5 个参数寄存器，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 起在栈上（入口 8(%rsp)，即 16(%rbp)）；16 字节结构体改用 %rax:%rdx 返回，无隐藏指针，第 6 个参数回到 %r9</p>\n"}